Data availability

            The ECMWF CAMS global reanalysis (EAC4) dataset is openly available from the CAMS Atmosphere Data Store (https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/datasets). Aerosol absorption optical depth (AAOD) retrievals are available from the AERONET website (https://aeronet.gsfc.nasa.gov/; last accessed 4 December 2025). The datasets generated in this study and used to produce the figures are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21351831 (ref. 69).
          Code availability

            The particle-resolved model PartMC is available at https://github.com/compdyn/partmc. Code used for PartMC data processing and post-simulation analysis is available at https://zenodo.org/records/7828104.
